                </div>
                <div purpose="feature-text">
                  <p>If your company already pays for Microsoft 365, Intune looks free. It’s now the most common MDM for Apple devices, at 35.5% of the admins in <a href="/announcements/apple-in-the-enterprise-2026">Fleet’s 2026 survey</a>. Mobile moves to the Windows team, and the Mac team ends up managing only part of your Apple devices.</p>
